<title>PHILIPPINES: PRCI posts Q4 net loss of 1.31 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>PRCI posts Q4 net loss of 1.31 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Racing Club Inc (PRCI) posted a net loss of 1.311 million pesos in the fourth quarter of last year, document submitted to the Philippine Stock Exchange on Thursday showed.  </p>
<p>Earlier, PRCI vice president for finance Teng Goh told Reuters that he expected net income to reach 10.1 to 10.2 million pesos for the full 1996 year, almost double from 5.146 millio pesos in the previous year.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
